    "rare_mythic_cap": "5 of 5 used — the cap is exactly spent. Mainboard: Spell Queller (R), Restoration Angel (R), Conjurer's Closet (R), Deadeye Navigator (R), Deserted Beach (R, land). Sideboard: 0 — all ten board cards are commons or uncommons. Cathars' Crusade and Mausoleum Wanderer were both cut on this constraint rather than on their merits, and are the first two cards to add if the cap is raised.",
